                     toggle one layer up. Visible only when STT and
                     LLM are the same vendor AND STT actually has a
                     saved key for that vendor. Without the
                     HasApiKey gate the toggle would offer to
                     "reuse" a non-existent STT key. Default ON.
                     OFF reveals the LLM API key input below so the
                     user can save a dedicated LLM-scope key. -->
                <controls:SettingCard x:Name="LlmUseSameKeyCard"
                                      Glyph="&#xE192;"
                                      Label="Use my saved API key for this provider"
                                      InfoTip="Dimmy already has a key for this provider. Turn off to enter a separate key just for rewrites."
                                      HelpUrl="https://dimmy.app/help/api-keys"
