                     upstream key exists (the key field below takes
                     over). Hidden also when the recap is on
                     subscription (no key needed). -->
                <controls:SettingCard x:Name="RecapUseSameKeyCard"
                                      Glyph="&#xE192;"
                                      Label="Use my saved API key for this provider"
                                      InfoTip="Dimmy already has a key for the recap provider. Turn off to enter a separate key just for recaps."
